    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgjD5_l6xUD7retmBKB8wos7WRFknCak4GicPy6YeuPW7MytgdvGgESH2pfdKP9u6h00tKDFCnB85_K7ZNqEqfd3rAoaYReUCMn6rFdeH8_UpY4y6PqbTfC1likLf5IVSrGBYu9t7PSukqJ2taQL2_xZ1lqgLfAHkutfHuj5AbPuGepk4ZQsvu_84dN4c15/s1424/351%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgjD5_l6xUD7retmBKB8wos7WRFknCak4GicPy6YeuPW7MytgdvGgESH2pfdKP9u6h00tKDFCnB85_K7ZNqEqfd3rAoaYReUCMn6rFdeH8_UpY4y6PqbTfC1likLf5IVSrGBYu9t7PSukqJ2taQL2_xZ1lqgLfAHkutfHuj5AbPuGepk4ZQsvu_84dN4c15/w450-h640/351%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large;\">封面作品</span></h3><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large; font-weight: normal;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/bong351.html\" target=\"_blank\">十粒卵</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large; font-weight: normal;\"><br /></span></div></h3><h3><span><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/bong351-e.html\" target=\"_blank\">編輯室ê話</a></span></span></h3><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div></div><div style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: large;\">做伙來唸詩</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">顏月華<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/blog-post_14.html\" target=\"_blank\">粒積</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>1</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">沈昱瑋<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2023/07/uma.html\" target=\"_blank\">UMA</a><br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400; white-space: normal;\">2</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; white-space: normal;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">陳昭蓉<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/blog-post_2.html\" target=\"_blank\">生理人</a><br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400; white-space: normal;\">3</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; white-space: normal;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">李鈺凰<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/blog-post_6.html\" target=\"_blank\">魚仔詩</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>3</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span></span><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿瑞--ā話仙</span></h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">藍春瑞<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/behe.html\" target=\"_blank\">阿本仔beh走ê前後</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>5</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span></span><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sio招來看戲</span></h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">陳育萱<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/looh.html\" target=\"_blank\">行！看戲--looh！</a></span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>6</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span></span><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心內話</span></h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">林春香<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/m.html\" target=\"_blank\">有溫暖有m̄甘</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>10</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">簡慈潔<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/tshua_17.html\" target=\"_blank\">Tshuā學生去畢業旅行</a><br />12</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">吳雪如<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/e_17.html\" target=\"_blank\">記憶中ê台語</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>14</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span></span><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣人寫真</span></h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">張雅芳<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/e_18.html\" target=\"_blank\">阮ê阿媽——施每</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>16</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">東北仔<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/e_42.html\" target=\"_blank\">東北仔ê老朋友</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>18</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span></span><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">地名研究室</span></h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">黃偉嘉<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/blog-post_18.html\" target=\"_blank\">哈瑪星</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>21</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span></span><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台語sa攏有講座</span></h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">主講／諶淑婷&nbsp;<br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">記錄／吳玉祥<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/mih.html\" target=\"_blank\">生產再發現<br /></a></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/mih.html\" target=\"_blank\">——台灣女性為啥mi̍h無法度安心生囝？</a><br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400; white-space: normal;\">22</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">光景bóng uē</span></h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">沈雨璇<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/blog-post_19.html\" target=\"_blank\">身心靈秘境——泰安溫泉</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>25</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">蔡婕馨<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/tsua.html\" target=\"_blank\">來去金門行一tsuā</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>27</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span></span><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sann-kap讀小說</span></h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">雁&nbsp; &nbsp; 翎<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/blog-post_22.html\" target=\"_blank\">招弟：（五）添丁</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>31</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span></span><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán來講看māi</span></h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">阿&nbsp; &nbsp; 熒<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/blog-post_99.html\" target=\"_blank\">故宮揣生物</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>35<br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">陳威綸<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/goa-tui-hak-sip-tai-gi-e-chit-koa-siu.html\" target=\"_blank\">Góa Tùi “Ha̍k-si̍p Tâi-gí” ê Chi̍t-kóa</a></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/goa-tui-hak-sip-tai-gi-e-chit-koa-siu.html\" target=\"_blank\">Siūⁿ-hoat<br /></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/goa-tui-hak-sip-tai-gi-e-chit-koa-siu.html\" target=\"_blank\">我對「學習台語」ê一寡想法</a><br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400; white-space: normal;\">37</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">寫hō͘學生朋友ê代誌</span></h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">陳&nbsp; &nbsp; 雷<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/mih-beh.html\" target=\"_blank\">為啥mi̍h beh用台語討論台灣文化？<br /></a></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/mih-beh.html\" target=\"_blank\">Ūi-siáⁿ-mi̍h Beh Iōng Tâi-gú Thó-lūn&nbsp;</a></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/07/mih-beh.html\" target=\"_blank\">Tâi-oân Bûn-hòa?</a><br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400; white-space: normal;\">43</span></span><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><div><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: x-large;\"><br /></div></div></span></div><div><span><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg42zSa4_qM96-ikIzcMp0oyceT7LrI9XWrqDaQOGigC3LKKjEXpfnMX_Y0txjpdCmy39IOgg97WVABQw60QRGMBF1ykUpvSdl1d7IbT6bnYrsaJj9PJPTNt3B-Qf1dewgyWy4wRuPwD9xLgB-L1N3fg7gZLIxWDHPQSck1o_o44FSPvgQsB0OyxTHQSboY/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1351%E6%9C%9F_.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg42zSa4_qM96-ikIzcMp0oyceT7LrI9XWrqDaQOGigC3LKKjEXpfnMX_Y0txjpdCmy39IOgg97WVABQw60QRGMBF1ykUpvSdl1d7IbT6bnYrsaJj9PJPTNt3B-Qf1dewgyWy4wRuPwD9xLgB-L1N3fg7gZLIxWDHPQSck1o_o44FSPvgQsB0OyxTHQSboY/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1351%E6%9C%9F_.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjHpX1X9oniHloGZLQAyzHP3EdpqgiYyG-JflTG9AsDIU_dyW38uLdX_-YtQbbLAE28zcZcxD-kJWkkk-cTk5F57cy4LCm-k9ylLeJXRb5Kp8UAF4LIBT9fkwTVZQsjorz_Q360RhFIkSXKPHeWDRdANh3Q-SKK9jAa_XQtDNNOh4woU0rgogMw9D5A7aCf/s1424/351%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9